{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Let's play a typing game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All you have to do is type what I tell you to.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You don't have to think about anything at all.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A pair of creepy, mysterious eyeballs is your game master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll follow their instructions to progress through a typing game...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >but also be forced to sign a rather unreasonable contract.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406810/extras/2ad112439391bc043e27f8b7bf1cb7a9.poster.avif?t=1773627751\" width=1170 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406810/extras/2ad112439391bc043e27f8b7bf1cb7a9.webm?t=1773627751\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406810/extras/2ad112439391bc043e27f8b7bf1cb7a9.mp4?t=1773627751\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whatever you type becomes reality and is inflicted upon you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You might be asked to run programs you don't want to,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or even hack your own system in an act of self-destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You might have to watch in horror as your computer breaks down before your very eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406810/extras/675ddb1a08a10ab83686eb0042b1376f.poster.avif?t=1773627751\" width=1170 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406810/extras/675ddb1a08a10ab83686eb0042b1376f.webm?t=1773627751\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406810/extras/675ddb1a08a10ab83686eb0042b1376f.mp4?t=1773627751\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's not much you can really do to fight against this, especially in a typing game...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But with the help of a cat awakened from an ancient game, perhaps you can escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406810/extras/48f29b51a8bbfd5f61a246c599909a35.poster.avif?t=1773627751\" width=1170 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406810/extras/48f29b51a8bbfd5f61a246c599909a35.webm?t=1773627751\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406810/extras/48f29b51a8bbfd5f61a246c599909a35.mp4?t=1773627751\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay and horror that breaks the fourth wall and threatens to affect reality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horror without gore or jumpscares.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark story hidden within an ancient game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A scoring system for the typing game. Can you get an S rank?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vastly upgraded experience from the free game DYPING, played by over 500,000 players online.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Game Clear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3406810/bbd3df3089b5b506d36947ec2efbb31909a82329.jpg"},{"name":"Incoming Crisis","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3406810/c32d6255f6e5699b57001c551c122d25d6bcc5fb.jpg"},{"name":"\u2605\u2605Typing Master\u2605\u2605","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3406810/b36f07facd1666119817013773f14073f2d64c6d.jpg"},{"name":"Auf Wiedersehen","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3406810/85145370585ca9f37bc94937517548a937d99b32.jpg"},{"name":"Goodbye.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3406810/bd80b6a283c475fb960c3fb2685a76d1baa5d5ac.jpg"},{"name":"I still have your signature.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3406810/34752bfcb89cabe4a061cb97b7f92491fbbe4b6e.jpg"}],"total":6},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3406810?t=1773627751","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406810/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773627751","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406810/ee56bf4f37569055d9d3d3d53dfdc2289a99e38c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773627751","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406810/ee56bf4f37569055d9d3d3d53dfdc2289a99e38c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773627751","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4080380,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Let's play a typing game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All you have to do is type what I tell you to.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You don't have to think about anything at all.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A pair of creepy, mysterious eyeballs is your game master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll follow their instructions to progress through a typing game...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >but also be forced to sign a rather unreasonable contract.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406810/extras/2ad112439391bc043e27f8b7bf1cb7a9.poster.avif?t=1773627751\" width=1170 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406810/extras/2ad112439391bc043e27f8b7bf1cb7a9.webm?t=1773627751\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406810/extras/2ad112439391bc043e27f8b7bf1cb7a9.mp4?t=1773627751\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whatever you type becomes reality and is inflicted upon you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You might be asked to run programs you don't want to,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or even hack your own system in an act of self-destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You might have to watch in horror as your computer breaks down before your very eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406810/extras/675ddb1a08a10ab83686eb0042b1376f.poster.avif?t=1773627751\" width=1170 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406810/extras/675ddb1a08a10ab83686eb0042b1376f.webm?t=1773627751\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406810/extras/675ddb1a08a10ab83686eb0042b1376f.mp4?t=1773627751\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's not much you can really do to fight against this, especially in a typing game...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But with the help of a cat awakened from an ancient game, perhaps you can escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406810/extras/48f29b51a8bbfd5f61a246c599909a35.poster.avif?t=1773627751\" width=1170 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406810/extras/48f29b51a8bbfd5f61a246c599909a35.webm?t=1773627751\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406810/extras/48f29b51a8bbfd5f61a246c599909a35.mp4?t=1773627751\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay and horror that breaks the fourth wall and threatens to affect reality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horror without gore or jumpscares.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark story hidden within an ancient game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A scoring system for the typing game. Can you get an S rank?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vastly upgraded experience from the free game DYPING, played by over 500,000 players online.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Heaviside Creations"],"dlc":[4489350],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406810/037588226344b77dabdf7dfac9d4ab1a63063022/header.jpg?t=1773627751","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9Heaviside Creations All rights reserved. Licensed to and published by Active Gaming Media Inc.","linux_requirements":[